  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A deuterium nucleus <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"{}^2_1\\text{H}\"></span> and a tritium nucleus <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"{}^3_1\\text{H}\"></span> undergo a fusion reaction to form a helium-4 nucleus <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"{}^4_2\\text{He}\"></span> and a neutron <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"{}^1_0\\text{n}\"></span>:</p>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"{}^2_1\\text{H} + {}^3_1\\text{H} \\rightarrow {}^4_2\\text{He} + {}^1_0\\text{n}\"></span></p>\n<p>The following table provides the rest masses of the particles involved:</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Particle</th><th>Rest mass / u</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"{}^2_1\\text{H}\"></span></td><td>2.0141</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"{}^3_1\\text{H}\"></span></td><td>3.0160</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"{}^4_2\\text{He}\"></span></td><td>4.0026</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"{}^1_0\\text{n}\"></span></td><td>1.0087</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>What is the energy released in this reaction?<br/>(Note: <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1 \\text{ u} = 931.5 \\text{ MeV } c^{-2}\"></span>)</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">1.75 MeV</li><li data-label=\"B\">14.2 MeV</li><li data-label=\"C\">17.5 MeV</li><li data-label=\"D\">28.3 MeV</li></ol>"
  },
